  "authors": "Carbon.WebApplication",
  "catalog:commitId": "0d32b2f2-ab7a-445c-8430-a3d394f06ba4",
  "catalog:commitTimeStamp": "2026-11-14T16:48:16.5898811Z",
  "created": "2026-11-14T16:41:54.9Z",
  "description": "5.2.0 - Consul crypto logic moved to shared Carbon.ConsulSecretEncryptor.Core (used by Console/Web tools). Consul JSON config supports whole-document (\"CarbonEncryptedConfig\") and field-level (\"ENC(...)\") encryption via AES-256-GCM+RSA-OAEP/SHA256 envelope, auto-decrypted on load and on reload-on-change. Consul HTTP Basic Auth support via CONSUL_BASIC_AUTH_ENCRYPTED.\n\t\t\t5.1.0 - Consul ACL token support via CONSUL_ACL_TOKEN_ENCRYPTED, decrypted using a host cert (CONSUL_ACL_CERT_THUMBPRINT/SUBJECT). Consul watch traffic tunable via CONSUL_RELOAD_ON_CHANGE/CONSUL_POLL_WAIT_TIME_SECONDS.\n\t\t\t5.0.1 - Replaced #if DEBUG checks with runtime ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Development check in UseCarbonFeatures.\n\t\t\t5.0.0 - Carbon.Audit/MassTransit updated to MassTransit 8; StackExchange.Redis 2.10.14; net6.0 logging/config abstractions raised to 8.0.x.\n\t\t\t4.8.0 - Configuration sources can be enabled/disabled via flags.\n\t\t\t4.7.1 - Exempt god users from token version validation.\n\t\t\t4.7.0 - net10.0 target added; uses ASP.NET Core shared framework instead of legacy Mvc 2.2 packages; zipkin4net excluded on net10.0.\n\t\t\t4.6.21 - Carbon.Audit: response error info (ApiStatusCode, ErrorCode, Messages) + DurationMs added; HttpStatusCodeFilter added for HTTP audit events.\n\t\t\t4.6.15 - Added CustomConfigureAfterAuth hook.\n\t\t\t4.6.14 - Prevent 401s when userId claim missing (client tokens).\n\t\t\t4.6.13 - Optional OnTokenValidated step checks Redis TokenVersion, rejecting tokens issued before a password change.\n\t\t\t4.6.11 - Updated vulnerable packages.\n\t\t\t4.6.10 - Defensive parsing for solution IDs in headers.\n\t\t\t4.6.7 - Caching added for fetching user roles.\n\t\t\t4.6.6 - OwnershipFilter refactored to async/await; improved auth header handling and permission checks.\n\t\t\t4.6.2 - .NET 8.0 target added.\n\t\t\t4.5.6 - Added overrideMessageAndCode property to CarbonException (default true). Fixed IPageableDto validator for PageSize 0.\n\t\t\t4.5.3 - Removed pageSize/pageNumber validation in Carbon.PagedList.\n\t\t\t4.5.2 - Carbon.Common: added StringExtensions (ReplaceTurkishChars, ContainsTurkishIgnoreCase).\n\t\t\t4.5.0 - Degraded health check now returns custom 218 (This Is Fine) instead of 5XX.\n\t\t\t4.4.1 - Cors now runs before authentication/authorization in pipeline.\n\t\t\t4.4.0 - Carbon.Common updated; Serilog.Enrichers.Sensitive added for masking sensitive log values.\n\t\t\t4.3.0 - OwnershipFilter disregards solution id header during endpoint permission check.\n\t\t\t4.2.0 - UnauthorizedOperationException handling added.\n\t\t\t4.1.8 - Carbon.Common updated; nested ordering supported.\n\t\t\t4.1.3 - Cors Allow Credentials with any origin + wildcard support.\n\t\t\t4.1.1 - CarbonException messages take arguments for dynamic messages.\n\t\t\t4.1.0 - Fixed directory separator char bug across platforms.\n\t\t\t4.0.0 - .NET 6 support (minimal and non-minimal); FluentValidation/Swagger upgraded; BodyRewind/RoleFilteredDto removed; performance improvements.",
